# Optional. Point Remotion at an existing browser instead of letting it download
# its own Chrome Headless Shell on first render.
#
# It must be a Chrome *Headless Shell* build, not a normal Chrome/Chromium:
# current Chrome binaries have removed the old headless mode that Remotion uses,
# and fail with "Old Headless mode has been removed from the Chrome binary".
#
#   Puppeteer cache:  ~/.cache/puppeteer/chrome-headless-shell-*/chrome-headless-shell
#   Playwright cache: ~/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-*/chrome-linux/headless_shell
#
# Leave this unset and Remotion downloads a correct binary for you.
#
# REMOTION_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE=/path/to/chrome-headless-shell

# Optional. Number of Chrome tabs used when rendering. Defaults to half your cores.
# REMOTION_CONCURRENCY=4

# Optional. OpenGL backend. Defaults to "swangle" (software), which is the
# reliable choice on machines without a GPU. Use "angle" if you have one.
# REMOTION_GL=angle
